# Bulk corpus directory — IRS Form 990-PF TEOS XML extracts (raw, ~4.8 GB)
# plus derived summaries (processed, ~99 MB). Regeneratable from the IRS
# bulk download endpoints; out of scope for the engineering repo. Track only
# the README that documents what lives here and how to refresh it.
# (Pattern is `data/*` not `data/` so git still descends and the README
# negation can match — git won't descend into a fully-ignored directory.)
/data/*
!/data/README.md

