docs/legal/

# === 2026-05-18 — Ed25519 seed material (defense-in-depth) ===
# Raw 32-byte Ed25519 seeds derive private signing keys. They live next to
# ceremony scripts during key-rotation work (e.g. cards-publisher rotation,
# operator-attestation rotation) and must never enter the public repo.
# Operator-canonical private seeds live under _private/ (deny-all line 98);
# this rule catches stray *.seed files anywhere in the tree.
*.seed

